# Production from line 1

Every file under `web/src` that users or staff will hit must be **production-quality**:

- Real routes, real copy, real CTAs — no “scaffold / coming soon / mockup path” placeholders on public pages
- Typed props, accessible markup, mobile-first, spacing scale 4–96
- No hardcoded secrets; env via `process.env`
- Menus/prices/hours from CMS/seed data — not invented mid-component forever
- Prefer small composable components over one giant page file
- Match `design/mockups/` UX intent; improve gaps, never regress clarity

Phased delivery = **which modules** we build next — not “ship junk then rewrite.”
